10 REM U07 GRAMMAR TEST: PLOT 29,X AND PLOT 30,X SECOND-BYTE BEHAVIOUR
20 REM WATCH FOR AN EXTRA CHARACTER OR CURSOR JUMP BETWEEN "A" AND "B" -
30 REM THAT WOULD MEAN X LEAKED THROUGH RATHER THAN BEING CONSUMED
33 DIM C(7)
40 C(1)= 20:C(2)= 23:C(3)= 18:C(4)= 22:C(5)= 19:C(6)= 17:C(7)= 16 
55 PLOT 3,0,0
50 PRINT "PLOT 29,X TEST (X=1-7)"
60 FOR I=1 TO 7
70 PLOT 3,0,I+2
80 PRINT "X=";I;" A";
90 PLOT 29,C(I)
100 PRINT "B"
110 NEXT I
120 PLOT 3,0,12
130 PRINT "PLOT 30,X TEST (X=1-7)"
140 FOR I=1 TO 7
150 PLOT 3,0,I+14
160 PRINT "X=";I;" A";
170 PLOT 30,C(I)
180 PRINT "B"
190 NEXT I
200 PLOT 3,0,24
210 PRINT "DONE"
220 END